@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Create a product (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Keyboard", "price": 49.90 }

### Invalid input (400 ValidationProblemDetails)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "price": 0 }

### Get a product: paste the id from the 201 response (404 if missing)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
